  diskItemId: data_disk_05
  entryText: 'The plants do lower radiation, Mara was right. Given time, given enough
    of them planted in the right places, this planet could heal. We just ran out
    of time before the planet ran out of patience with us.


    - K. Reyes, Final
    Log'
